    "content_html": "<div class=\"articlebodycontent col-xl-9 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12\" id=\"content-body-71716856\"><div class=\"schemaDiv\" id=\"schemaDiv\"><p><span class=\"drop-caps\">S</span>ickness never heralds its arrival, so buying medical insurance today ensures you are never caught off guard. Having been in the banking sector where medical expenses were cushioned to a certain extent, we retirees are now facing a financial crunch as we age.</p><p>Nothing is free today. Every year around the same time, retirees scramble to decide which insurance company has the most attractive offer. After the coronavirus visited the globe in a devastating manner in the year 2020, every hospitalisation has become a steep affair. Terms and conditions rolled out year-on-year for group insurance schemes vary. It fits well within the budget of some, while many have to prepare well in advance to pay off the stipulated amount.</p></div><div class=\"articleblock-container\" id=\"arthardpv\"></div><div class=\"update-publish-time article-published-time-end\"><p class=\"publish-time-new\"> Published <span>- November 22, 2026 05:00 am IST</span></p></div><div class=\"comments-shares share-page flex print-hide\" data-artid=\"71716856\" data-title=\"Walk and be insured\" data-url=\"https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/walk-and-be-insured/article71716856.ece\"><div class=\"left\"><div class=\"share\"><button class=\"btn share-btn\" data-ga-labelclick=\"ArticleShare\"></button><ul class=\"share-list bottom\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"copy-link\" data-cf-modified-2d587816d4857353e3852af1-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; copytext('https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/walk-and-be-insured/article71716856.ece');\">\n                Copy link  \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"email\"><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Walk%20and%20be%20insured&amp;amp;body=Check%20out%20this%20link%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thehindu.c