    "title": "The virtue of forgiving",
    "subtitle": null,
    "author": "George Netto",
    "published_at": null,
    "image_url": null,
    "image_caption": null,
    "content_html": "<div class=\"articlebodycontent col-xl-9 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12\" id=\"content-body-71716933\"><div class=\"schemaDiv\" id=\"schemaDiv\"><p><span class=\"drop-caps\">D</span>espite knowing full well that wars are notoriously internecine, there has been little or no let-up in global conflicts in recent years. From time to time, warring (and war-devastated) countries proclaim their readiness to bury the hatchet. However, few ever forget where it’s buried. And therein lies the crux of the matter.</p><p>To be meaningful, rapprochement should clearly spell out (and not merely imply) a genuine and sincere willingness to mutually forgive and resolutely breakaway from the barbaric practice of retribution or claiming an eye for an eye. True forgiveness is, in essence, a heart-soothing balm — in equal measure to both the survivor of a crime (or one affected by it) and the perpetrator.</p></div><div class=\"articleblock-container\" id=\"arthardpv\"></div><div class=\"update-publish-time article-published-time-end\"><p class=\"publish-time-new\"> Published <span>- November 22, 2026 04:15 am IST</span></p></div><div class=\"comments-shares share-page flex print-hide\" data-artid=\"71716933\" data-title=\"The virtue of forgiving\" data-url=\"https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/the-virtue-of-forgiving/article71716933.ece\"><div class=\"left\"><div class=\"share\"><button class=\"btn share-btn\" data-ga-labelclick=\"ArticleShare\"></button><ul class=\"share-list bottom\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"copy-link\" data-cf-modified-3a772d8e7420702736f1fc11-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; copytext('https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/the-virtue-of-forgiving/article71716933.ece');\">\n                Copy link  \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"email\"><a href=\"mailto:?subject=The%20virtue%20of%20forgiving&amp;amp;body=Check%20out%20this%20link%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thehindu.co